# Research outputs stay local; keep source, writeups, and reproduction inputs.
/reports/behavioral_baseline/**
/reports/learned_lr/**
/reports/locked_shared/**
/reports/paired_error_2d/**
/reports/smart_descent/**
/reports/transfer_suite/**
!/reports/**/
